pub outcome err ┄ C3 trailing on outcome header
├ bad {code: u32} ┄ C4 trailing on alternative
┄ C5 between alternatives
└ late

control go(n: u32) ┄ C6 trailing on signature line
    ■ done {out: u32} ┄ C7 trailing on contract continuation
    ■ failed
│ ┄ C8 first line of body
│ x: u32 := n + 1 ┄ C9 trailing on a statement
│ Δ ask(x) ┄ C10 trailing on a decision header
│ ┄ C11 between header and arms
│ ├ a {v} → ┄ C12 trailing on an arm that opens a block
│ │ ┆ ┄ C13 inside an arm block
│ │ ┆ ■ done {v}
│ ┄ C14 between arms
│ ├ b ┄ C15 trailing on an arm
│ └ c → ■ failed
│
│ ? x > 3 → ┄ C16 trailing on a test header
│ ┆ ┄ C17 inside a test block
│ ┆ ■ failed
│ ↻ spin(i: u32 := 0) ┄ C18 trailing on a loop header
│ ║ ┄ C19 inside a loop
│ ║ ? i = 3 → □ ┄ C20 trailing in a loop
│ ║ ↑ spin(i + 1)
╞═ b ┄ C21 trailing on a label
│ ┆ ┄ C22 inside a label block
│ ┆ ■ failed
│ ■ done {x} ┄ C23 trailing on last statement
╵
┄ C24 after the body
